From: "keepup[bot]" <keepup[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix(examples): move the anthropic example off a retired
 model

Anthropic retired claude-sonnet-4-20250514 on the Claude API on
15 Jun 2026, so every request from examples/minimal/anthropic.toml
now returns an error. Move the minimal Anthropic example to
claude-sonnet-5, the current Sonnet on 1 Sep 2026.

Replay date: 2026-09-01.
Source: Claude Platform release notes,
https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/release-notes/overview
---
 examples/minimal/anthropic.toml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/examples/minimal/anthropic.toml b/examples/minimal/anthropic.toml
index 0b353d04..4efff7fe 100644
--- a/examples/minimal/anthropic.toml
+++ b/examples/minimal/anthropic.toml
@@ -11,5 +11,5 @@ system_prompt = "You are a helpful assistant."
 [agent.llm]
 provider = "anthropic"
 api_key = "{{ env.ANTHROPIC_API_KEY }}"
-model = "claude-sonnet-4-20250514"
+model = "claude-sonnet-5"
 
